{"id":"ab29eca0895539ff","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-halting-undecidability.md","title":"停机语言不可判定","display":"thm-halting-undecidability — 停机语言不可判定","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-halting-undecidability","aliases":["28-thm-halting-undecidability"],"display":"thm-halting-undecidability — 停机语言不可判定","depends_on":["[[28-df-halting-language]]","[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-computation]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 1.11 and proof","source_printed_pages":"23","source_pdf_pages":"49","source_status":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-halting-undecidability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-halting-undecidability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-halting-undecidability — 停机语言不可判定"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"89e240fe2a8a5b0c\" href=\"?note=89e240fe2a8a5b0c\" title=\"28-df-halting-language\">28-df-halting-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 1.11 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"23"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"49"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HALT}\">\\(\\mathrm{HALT}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"89e240fe2a8a5b0c\" href=\"?note=89e240fe2a8a5b0c\" title=\"28-df-halting-language\">28-df-halting-language</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M)\">\\(L(M)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Halt}\">\\(\\operatorname{Halt}\\)</span> 使用本目录确定型机器接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\left[L(H)=\\mathrm{HALT}\\land\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{Halt}_H(y)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\left[L(H)=\\mathrm{HALT}\\land\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{Halt}_H(y)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若有总判定器H，构造程序B：输入机器描述α，询问H(〈α,α〉)；若接受便无限循环，若拒绝便停机。取α为B自身有效描述，B(α)停机当且仅当B(α)不停机，矛盾。构造只使用可计算配对、解析和模拟；无效输入分支任意固定，不影响自身有效描述。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 1.11 and proof；印刷 pp.23 / PDF pp.49。本次核对范围：原书对应陈述及本注内所列论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-halting-language","status":"resolved","id":"89e240fe2a8a5b0c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-halting-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-halting-language","status":"resolved","id":"89e240fe2a8a5b0c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HALT}$ 见 [[28-df-halting-language]]；$\\mathrm{TM}$、$L(M)$、$\\operatorname{Halt}$ 使用本目录确定型机器接口。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{HALT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"L(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Halt}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\left[L(H)=\\mathrm{HALT}\\land\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{Halt}_H(y)\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1521,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-275","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-ex-palindrome-linear-time]]、[[28-thm-binary-alphabet-simulation]]、[[28-thm-uncomputable-diagonal-language]]、[[28-df-halting-language]]、[[28-thm-halting-undecidability]]。"}],"outgoing":["89e240fe2a8a5b0c","1965e2b0765554c9","256220eba4eba968"]}